{
  "$schema": "https://agent-plugins.org/schemas/1.0.0/plugin.schema.json",
  "name": "plugin-manager",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "管插件：搜插件市场、看某插件会带来哪些能力、安装（可填凭据）、停用/启用、卸载，以及导入自制或网址来的插件包。用户说「装个能做 X 的插件」「我装了哪些插件」「把那个插件卸了」时加载。只管插件本身；技能归 skill-manager，智能体归 agent-manager。",
  "author": {
    "name": "HugAgentOS"
  },
  "extensions": {
    "org.hugagent": {
      "mcp": {
        "plugin_manager": {
          "display_name": "插件管理",
          "description": "管理当前执行环境的私有插件。本机安装读取目录或压缩包；云端安装读取当前账号的产物。上传云端和申请市场发布分别执行。",
          "tools": [
            {
              "name": "search_plugin_market",
              "description": "搜索插件市场，返回可安装的插件列表（slug/名称/分类/简介/是否已安装）。\n\n    用户想\"有没有能连飞书的插件 / 插件市场里有什么 / 找个能做 X 的插件\"时调用。\n    - query：关键词（在 slug/名称/简介/分类里模糊匹配；留空=列全部）。\n    - category：按分类过滤（可选）。\n    找到目标后**建议先用 get_plugin_info(slug)** 看看它会带进来什么，再决定装不装。\n    ",
              "inputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "query": {
                    "default": "",
                    "title": "Query",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "category": {
                    "default": "",
                    "title": "Category",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "title": "search_plugin_marketArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "outputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "result": {
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "title": "Result",
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "result"
                ],
                "title": "search_plugin_marketOutput",
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "get_plugin_info",
              "description": "查看某个插件的详情：会给你装进来哪些技能、哪些工具，需不需要填 API Key 之类的凭据。\n\n    【安装前先调它，把\"装了会多出什么\"讲给用户听】，别让用户装完才发现还要填密钥。\n    用户问\"这插件是干嘛的 / 装了会怎样 / 它安全吗\"时也用它。\n    返回里的 required_secrets 就是安装时要准备的凭据清单。\n    ",
              "inputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "slug": {
                    "title": "Slug",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "slug"
                ],
                "title": "get_plugin_infoArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "outputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "result": {
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "title": "Result",
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "result"
                ],
                "title": "get_plugin_infoOutput",
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "install_plugin_from_marketplace",
              "description": "从插件市场安装一个插件到我的空间，装完里面的技能和工具立即可用。\n\n    用户说\"装上它 / 安装 X 插件 / 把这个能力加上\"时调用。slug 取自 search_plugin_market。\n    - secrets：按插件 required_secrets 的 key 传入凭据，例如 {\"FIRECRAWL_API_KEY\":\"...\"}。\n      如果该插件需要凭据而你没传，会返回缺哪些 key——这时**先向用户要**，拿到后重试，\n      不要自己编一个假的填进去。\n    【铁律】未成功拿到 ✅ 前不要声称已安装。需要管理员开启\"自助导入插件\"权限。\n    ",
              "inputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "slug": {
                    "title": "Slug",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "secrets": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "additionalProperties": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "object"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "null"
                      }
                    ],
                    "default": null,
                    "title": "Secrets"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "slug"
                ],
                "title": "install_plugin_from_marketplaceArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "outputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "result": {
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "title": "Result",
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "result"
                ],
                "title": "install_plugin_from_marketplaceOutput",
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "install_plugin",
              "description": "安装插件到当前用户的云端私有库。接收当前云端包产物 ID，不接收本机路径。同名内容不同时返回冲突，请显式更新。成功后返回安装 ID、版本及可用状态。",
              "inputSchema": {
                "$defs": {
                  "ArtifactSource": {
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "kind": {
                        "const": "artifact",
                        "title": "Kind",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "artifact_id": {
                        "title": "Artifact Id",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "kind",
                      "artifact_id"
                    ],
                    "title": "ArtifactSource",
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                },
                "properties": {
                  "source": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/ArtifactSource"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "source"
                ],
                "title": "installArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "annotations": {
                "readOnlyHint": false
              },
              "_meta": {
                "org.hugagent/executor": {
                  "id": "plugin-manager",
                  "version": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "list_plugins",
              "description": "列出当前用户云端已安装的插件，返回精确安装 ID 和 revision。",
              "inputSchema": {
                "properties": {},
                "title": "list_installedArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "annotations": {
                "readOnlyHint": true
              },
              "_meta": {
                "org.hugagent/executor": {
                  "id": "plugin-manager",
                  "version": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "get_plugin",
              "description": "读取一个已安装插件的版本、内容位置与组件信息。",
              "inputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "install_id": {
                    "title": "Install Id",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "install_id"
                ],
                "title": "getArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "annotations": {
                "readOnlyHint": true
              },
              "_meta": {
                "org.hugagent/executor": {
                  "id": "plugin-manager",
                  "version": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "update_plugin",
              "description": "用完整包更新已有插件，先读取当前 revision。版本变化则拒绝覆盖。插件及子组件一起更新；插件内技能必须通过插件管理。",
              "inputSchema": {
                "$defs": {
                  "ArtifactSource": {
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "kind": {
                        "const": "artifact",
                        "title": "Kind",
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "artifact_id": {
                        "title": "Artifact Id",
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "kind",
                      "artifact_id"
                    ],
                    "title": "ArtifactSource",
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                },
                "properties": {
                  "install_id": {
                    "title": "Install Id",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "source": {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/ArtifactSource"
                  },
                  "expected_revision": {
                    "title": "Expected Revision",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "install_id",
                  "source",
                  "expected_revision"
                ],
                "title": "updateArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "annotations": {
                "readOnlyHint": false
              },
              "_meta": {
                "org.hugagent/executor": {
                  "id": "plugin-manager",
                  "version": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "uninstall_plugin",
              "description": "撤销当前用户的插件安装登记。插件及子组件一起卸载，保留导入源文件和历史版本，不删除云端副本。",
              "inputSchema": {
                "properties": {
                  "install_id": {
                    "title": "Install Id",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "expected_revision": {
                    "title": "Expected Revision",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "install_id",
                  "expected_revision"
                ],
                "title": "uninstallArguments",
                "type": "object"
              },
              "annotations": {
                "readOnlyHint": false
              },
              "_meta": {
                "org.hugagent/executor": {
                  "id": "plugin-manager",
                  "version": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "local_execution": {
        "id": "plugin-manager",
        "version": 1
      }
    }
  }
}
